<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - J.P. Morgan starts Apasco.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - J.P. Morgan starts Apasco.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- J.P. Morgan Securities Inc said on Monday it had started Mexico's Apasco SA de CV as a market performer.</p>
<p>-- In a statement, the brokerage said, &quot;A steady domestic market recovery combined with recently realized Mexican cement price gains should lead to outstanding 68 percent growth in dollar cash earnings this year.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
